      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sometimes, I wonder whether VRChat could do a better job of protecting its users. But I honestly can't remember their last update on the topic. (It's been at least a year?)\n\nI'm curious about what steps they have planned, to make VRChat a safer and more trustworthy platform.",
