      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As VRChat starts to grow its userbase more exponentially and to work towards improving new user experience, it'd soon become a necessity to provide more transparency regarding moderation as the platform becomes more mainstream.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
